      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.1.04-14",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "The Namibian 2023 census provides a dated population baseline rather than a forecast. The Statistics Agency reports a total of 3,022,401 for that census. Later population, migration or growth claims need their own estimates and dates. Census categories and age bands should be read directly before calculating an indicator, because a table using ages fifteen to fifty-nine cannot be substituted silently into a formula defined for fifteen to sixty-four.",
