    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.1.04-22",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Selected examples should therefore retain their dates. China's stated 2021 change and Japan's dated childcare-support measures illustrate contrasting concerns and instruments, while Namibia's census supplies a population baseline. None is a substitute for a current estimate or a complete causal evaluation. The case's contribution is strongest when its observed fact is connected to a clear mechanism and its limits are acknowledged.",
      "claim_ids": [
